  2. Publishing a derivative work, a fork or a modified version.
  3. Reusing any part of the code in another project.
  4. Any commercial use.

The official distribution channels are the releases of this GitHub repository,
plus Modrinth and CurseForge under the copyright holder's account. A jar obtained
anywhere else is not covered by this license and should not be trusted.

